  "hooks": [
    {
      "text": "死亡会丢失金币和临时加成，但装备、符文与解锁内容全部带入下一轮",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "When you fall, you lose gold and temporary bonuses, but your gear and runes stay with you and form the base of your next attempt.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2803280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "元素魔剑士、以血换伤狂战士与投掷毒素猎人形成三套截然不同战法",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Spellblade - Element-focused hybrid with close and mid-range attacks built around fire, frost, and lightning. Berserker - Heavy melee bruiser that trades its own HP and positioning for huge damage and armor. Hunter - Mobile ranged fighter using thrown weapons, poison, and beast abilities to apply damage over time and control space.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2803280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "击败精英与Boss取得符文石，锻造成传奇或神话装备并与技能树、神器联动",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "Hunt Elites and Bosses to claim Rune Stones, then craft them into Legendary and Mythic equipment. Runes and class skill trees interact to define your build, while artifacts you pick up mid-run stack into powerful synergies.",
      "url": "https://store.steampowered.com/app/2803280/",
      "label": "证据原文片段"
    }
  ],
